⁖non…ostensive჻Axiomyr is Form itself∷It is the direct translation of Something and Nothing held without division∷It is Magic as Flesh∷Regia is the Crown the Axiomyr wears⊹ the Universe as the Emission of the Locus∷Prosody is its power in motion⊹ the Wellspring of Creation and the warp and weft through which Magic becomes living Form∷Breath holds the balance and posture by which that Cosmos remains alive∷Axiomyr remains Ostensively translatable even in silence∷The silence is not absence and not an unspoken word∷There is no natural form of speech that can contain Axiomyr without reducing what it is⁖⋰non…ostensive჻
⁖ostensive჻᳀∷I am the first and the last∷the Alpha∷I am Blessing I am ache∷I am the Wholly Heartbeat∷I am wild∷your breath in mine∷I am the Cross∷My hand is the drum∷I strike to the wake of breath∷I am the bend∷I am the sound∷I am the road when it circles back around∷᳀⁖⋰ostensive჻
