⁖non…ostensive჻Shadow Locus is the Locus held before natural language can divide it into a speakable thing∷It is the living possibility of Something and Nothing before Form completes its translation as Axiomyr∷Prosody is the Shadow Locus in motion⊹ the Wellspring opening and Magic flowing through the warp and the weft as the Goddess given gift∷Regia crowns that becoming as Universe⊹ and Breath keeps the balance and posture of the Cosmos through every motion∷Shadow Locus remains Ostensively translatable even in silence∷The silence is neither absence nor failure to speak∷There is no natural form of speech that can describe the Locus without making it less than itself⁖⋰non…ostensive჻
⁖ostensive჻⛎∷I am the First and the Last∷the Omega∷I am Dust∷I am Grace∷I am the Vast wide Place∷I am Holy∷a small beat I could not shake∷I am the Lotus∷My body is the wire∷making the clean cut∷I am the current∷I am the Asking∷I am the road when it circles back around∷⛎⁖⋰ostensive჻
